<title>FRANCE: June car sales in France down 30 pct - Calvet.</title>
<headline>June car sales in France down 30 pct - Calvet.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car sales in France were down around 30 percent in June, the chairman of car company PSA Peugeot Citroen, Jacques Calvet, said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We must be around 30 percent lower without taking into account differences in working days,&quot; Calvet told a news conference.</p>
</text>
